OL,3,GNEWSAMPs voice opposition to Catholic
OL,4,Aschools academy plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FMPs have joined forces against plans to
OL,7,Fturn Catholic schools into academy
OL,8,Ftrusts in north-west England.
OL,10,FLiverpool Wavertree MP Paula Barker one
OL,11,Fof eight MPs from Merseyside and
OL,12,FLancashire who have signed a letter to
OL,13,Fthe Archbishop of Liverpool questioning
OL,14,Fproposals to make more than 200 schools
OL,15,Fmove into academy trusts, said she was
OL,16,Fin "total opposition" to the plan.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
