OL,3,GNEWSAMPs voice opposition to Catholic
OL,4,Aschools academy plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after strikes at schools in
OL,7,FLancashire and Merseyside with the
OL,8,FNational Education Union (NEU) saying
OL,9,Fmembers at Liverpool's St Austin's
OL,10,FCatholic Primary School have voted for
OL,11,Fstrike action.
OL,13,FThe Diocese of Lancaster has said the
OL,14,Fplans would guarantee "high-quality
OL,15,FCatholic education".
